{"id":"4ca21511bbcedbcd","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-so-nat.md","title":"Categoricity of Second-Order Peano Arithmetic","display":"thm-so-nat — Categoricity of Second-Order Peano Arithmetic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-so-nat","aliases":["57-thm-so-nat"],"display":"thm-so-nat — Categoricity of Second-Order Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-so-semantics]]","[[57-df-mod]]","[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-so-sentence]]","[[57-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-so-nat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-so-nat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-so-nat — Categoricity of Second-Order Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"521852a49020f617\" href=\"?note=521852a49020f617\" title=\"57-df-so-semantics\">57-df-so-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f299cb3aecfed079\" href=\"?note=f299cb3aecfed079\" title=\"57-df-mod\">57-df-mod</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fcf8e66483555f57\" href=\"?note=fcf8e66483555f57\" title=\"57-df-so-sentence\">57-df-so-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b82abcee4938fc49\" href=\"?note=b82abcee4938fc49\" title=\"57-df-isomorphism\">57-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> 的七条 Robinson 公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_2\">\\(\\iota_2\\)</span>、二阶派生联结词及完全二阶满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"521852a49020f617\" href=\"?note=521852a49020f617\" title=\"57-df-so-semantics\">57-df-so-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,1}^2\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,1}^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}})\\)</span> 在本文件专指下式的二阶模型类；与一阶 Mod 的输入类型区分。类表达式在背景类理论中解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_2\\coloneqq\\forall X\\bigl((X(0)\\land\\forall x(X(x)\\to X(\\mathrm Sx)))\\to\\forall xX(x)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ind}_2\\coloneqq\\forall X\\bigl((X(0)\\land\\forall x(X(x)\\to X(\\mathrm Sx)))\\to\\forall xX(x)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\coloneqq\\{\\iota_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Ind}_2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\coloneqq\\{\\iota_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in Q\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Ind}_2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}})\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}})\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S:\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2,\\qquad\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2,\\qquad\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原先只有名字的二阶 Peano 公理集。唯一同构类型用所有模型与标准结构同构表达，不对未构造成集合的真类商直接取集合基数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-S-ar]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-mod","status":"resolved","id":"f299cb3aecfed079","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-mod]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d3a421d8f589e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-formula","status":"resolved","id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"5